@ 37.1.2.1.2 - Cayuga to Lower Cayuga
# citation: cedh audmanh, from Julian, Charles (2010), “A History of the Iroquoian Languages”, University of Manitoba, Winnipeg “Allophonic changes:”
	t͡s > t / :{ _hr, _r }:
	t > k / _j
	V > V:[-voice] / _h (odd syllables only)
	{ tʔ, t͡sʔ, kʔ, kʷʔ } > { tʼ, t͡sʼ, kʼ, kʷʼ }
	s > ʃ / :{ _r, _j }:
	{ t, k, kʷ } > { d, ɡ, ɡʷ } / :{ _V }: // _V:[-voice]